        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inzu ya Ahabu irimburwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Ahabu yari afite abahungu mirongo irindwi i Samariya. Bukeye Yehu yandika inzandiko, azoherereza abakuru b'abatware b'i Yezerēli, n'abareraga abana ba Ahabu i Samariya, arabandikira ngo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uru rwandiko nirubageraho ubwo mufite bene shobuja, kandi mufite amagare n'amafarashi n'umudugudu ugoswe n'inkike, mufite n'ibyo kurwanisha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimutoranye muri bene shobuja umwiza ukwiriye mube ari we mushyira ku ntebe y'ubwami bwa se, murwanire inzu ya shobuja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko baratinya cyane baravugana bati “Ubwo abo bami bombi batashoboye kumuhagarara imbere ni twe twabishobora?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko umunyarugo n'umutware w'umurwa n'abakuru n'abareraga abo bana batuma kuri Yehu bati “Turi abagaragu bawe, ibyo udutegeka byose tuzabikora kandi nta muntu wese tuzimika, ahubwo ubigenze uko ushaka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yongera kubandikira urwandiko ubwa kabiri, ngo “Niba muri abanjye mukanyumvira, nimuce ibihanga bya bene shobuja, ejo nk'iki gihe muzabinsangishe i Yezerēli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icyo gihe abana b'umwami uko ari mirongo irindwi, bari kumwe n'abakuru b'umurwa babarerega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urwo rwandiko rubagezeho, bafata abana b'umwami babica uko ari mirongo irindwi, ibihanga byabo babishyira mu nkangara babimwoherereza i Yezerēli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intumwa iraza iramubwira iti “Bazanye ibihanga by'abana b'umwami.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aravuga ati “Nimubirunde ibirundo bibiri ku irembo, bihagume bigeze ejo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye bwaho arasohoka yiyereka abantu bose, arababwira ati “Muri abakiranutsi. Jyeweho nagomeye databuja ndamwica, ariko uwishe aba bose ni nde? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mumenye ko ari nta jambo na rimwe Uwiteka yavuze ku nzu ya Ahabu rizagwa hasi, kuko Uwiteka ashohoje ibyo yavugiye mu mugaragu we Eliya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 1.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hanyuma Yehu atsemba abari basigaye mu b'inzu ya Ahabu bose bari i Yezerēli, abakuru be bose n'incuti ze z'amagara n'abatambyi be, ntiyasigaza n'uw'indamyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yehu arahaguruka avayo, ajya i Samariya. Ageze ku nzu y'abashumba iri ku nzira ikemurirwamo ubwoya bw'intama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahura na bene se wa Ahaziya umwami w'Abayuda arababaza ati “Muri izihe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baramusubiza bati “Turi bene se wa Ahaziya, turamanuka tujya kuramutsa abana b'umwami n'abana b'umwamikazi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwira abari kumwe na we ati “Nimubafate mpiri.” Babafata mpiri, babicira ku rwobo rwo ku nzu ikemurirwamo ubwoya bw'intama. Bose bari abagabo mirongo ine na babiri, nta n'umwe yarokoye muri bo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu agira ishyaka ryo kurwanya Bāli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avuye aho ahura na Yehonadabu mwene Rekabu aje kumusanganira, aramuramutsa aramubaza ati “Umutima wawe uratunganye nk'uko uwanjye utunganiye uwawe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehonadabu aramusubiza ati “Uratunganye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " “Niba utunganye, mpa ukuboko kwawe.” Arakumuha, aherako aramwuriza amushyira mu igare rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aravuga ati “Nuko tujyane, urebe ishyaka ndwanira Uwiteka.” Nuko amujyana mu igare rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ageze i Samariya, atsemba abari basigaye bose mu bantu ba Ahabu bari i Samariya, kugeza aho yabarimburiye nk'uko Uwiteka yabwiye Eliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Yehu ateranya abantu bose, arababwira ati “Ahabu yakoreye Bāli buhoro, ariko Yehu azamukorera cyane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko nimumpamagarire nonaha abahanuzi ba Bāli bose, n'abamuramyaga bose n'abatambyi be bose. Ntihagire n'umwe ubura kuko nenda gutambira Bāli igitambo gikomeye. Uzabura wese ntazandokoka.” Ariko Yehu yabigenjeje atyo mu buryarya, kugira ngo abone uko yatsemba abaramyaga Bāli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yehu aravuga ati “Nimuteranire Bāli guterana kwera.” Barabyamamaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu atuma ku Bisirayeli bose. Nuko abaramyaga Bāli bose baraza, ntihagira umuntu n'umwe usigara ataje. Baraza binjira mu ngoro ya Bāli, ingoro ya Bāli iruzura, uhereye mu ruhande rumwe ukageza mu rundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yehu abwira utegeka inzu ibikwamo imyambaro ati “Zanira abaramya Bāli bose imyambaro.” Arayibazanira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yehu azana na Yehonadabu mwene Rekabu, binjira mu ngoro ya Bāli. Abwira abaramya Bāli ati “Nimushake murebe muri mwe hataba harimo n'umwe wo mu bagaragu b'Uwiteka, keretse abaramya Bāli bonyine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko barinjira ngo batambe igitambo n'ibitambo byoswa. Ariko Yehu yari yashyize hanze abagabo mirongo inani arababwira ati “Aba bagabo mbashyize mu maboko yanyu. Nihagira ucika, umubuze azamuryora, apfe mu cyimbo cye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamaze gutamba igitambo cyoswa, Yehu abwira abarinzi n'abatware ati “Nimwinjire mubice, ntihagire usohoka n'umwe.” Nuko babicisha inkota, hanyuma abarinzi n'abatware babajugunya hanze, binjira mu rurembo rw'ingoro ya Bāli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basohora inkingi zari mu ngoro ya Bāli barazitwika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze bamenagura igishushanyo cya Bāli, basenya ingoro ye, bayihindura icyavu na bugingo n'ubu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni ko Yehu yarimbuye Bāli, amukura muri Isirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
