            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.28+1KI.12.29+1KI.12.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abami 12.28-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariko rero Yehu ntiyaretse gukurikiza ibyaha bya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ibyo yoheje Abisirayeli ngo bacumure, n'iby'ibigirwamana by'izahabu byari i Beteli n'i Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Uwiteka abwira Yehu ati “Kuko wakoze neza ubwo washohoje ibishimwa imbere yanjye ukagirira inzu ya Ahabu nk'uko imigambi yanjye yari iri, abana bawe bazicara ku ntebe y'ubwami bwa Isirayeli kugeza ku buvivi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Yehu ntiyita ku kugendera mu mategeko y'Uwiteka Imana ya Isirayeli n'umutima we wose, ntiyava mu byaha Yerobowamu yoheje Abisirayeli ngo bacumure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri iyo minsi Uwiteka atangira kugabanya Abisirayeli. Hazayeli abatsinda mu ngabano za Isirayeli zose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uhereye kuri Yorodani ukajya iburasirazuba, igihugu cyose cy'i Galeyadi n'icy'Abagadi, n'icy'Abarubeni n'icy'Abamanase, uhereye Aroweri hahereranye n'ikibaya cya Arunoni ukageza i Galeyadi n'i Bashani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
